xnu: 0199 vince Pronto: 19.2 MHz Iris first, 30 s per WCNSS_CTRL step

0198 on the phone: GPIO 76..80 were plain GPIOs (0x1), now 0x87. 48 MHz still
never comes up (the Iris is a 19.2 MHz WCN3615-class part); at 19.2 MHz the
firmware now created WCNSS_CTRL but did not answer the version request or
the NV download within 4-6 s - it can reach the Iris now and calibrates
first. Wait up to 30 s for each answer; try 19.2 MHz (then with the NV
flag, then LK settings) and drop 48 MHz.

